@startuml
' ==========================================================
' LocAi Architecture – detailed component view
' ==========================================================
' Packages for logical grouping
package "LocAi Core" {
  [Server]           as server   <<Component>>
  [RAG Manager]      as rag      <<Component>>
  [Model Router]     as model    <<Component>>
  [CLI]              as cli      <<Component>>
  [GUI]              as gui      <<Component>>
  [Launcher]         as launcher <<Component>>
}

' ==========================================================
' Internal data stores
' ==========================================================
node "ChromaDB\n(local_rag_db)" as db <<Database>>
node "Config File\nconfig.json" as cfg <<File>>
node "Persistent\nCache\n(.venv)" as venv <<Folder>>

' ==========================================================
' External services
' ==========================================================
cloud "Ollama API\nhttp://localhost:11434" as ollama <<Service>>
cloud "FastAPI HTTP\nPort 8000" as http <<Service>>

' ==========================================================
' Relationships – API calls & data flow
' ==========================================================
server --> model  : uses\nmodel_router.chat_stream()
server --> rag    : utilizes\nRAGManager.query()
server --> http   : exposes REST endpoints
server --> cfg    : reads/writes model config

cli --> http        : POST /model, /chat, /rag/add
cli --> model       : invokes model_router methods
gui --> http        : POST /chat, GET /model
launcher --> gui    : launches GUI process
launcher --> server : starts FastAPI app
launcher --> venv   : activates virtual env

model --> ollama    : HTTP POST /chat & /generate
rag --> db          : add_document(), query()
db --> rag          : returns document chunks

' ==========================================================
' Additional notes
' ==========================================================
note right of server
  • FastAPI application
  • Handles model selection, RAG integration,
    health checks, and model management
end note

note right of rag
  • Handles PDF/DOCX/TXT ingestion
  • Chunking (1000 chars, 200 overlap)
  • Stores vectors in ChromaDB
end note

note right of model
  • Streams tokens via Ollama chat endpoint
  • Fallback to generate endpoint
  • Model list & pull utilities
end note

@enduml
